{"updated_at":"2026-09-07T13:31:27+08:00","frags":{"cross":"\n<div class=\"con-scenario\"><div class=\"con-tagcell\">SCENARIO<span>判讀</span></div><div class=\"con-body\"><details class=\"event-panel\" id=\"judgment\" style=\"background:#12151c;border:1px solid #2a3140;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 16px;margin:0 0 12px;scroll-margin-top:64px\"><summary style=\"list-style:none;cursor:pointer;outline:none\"><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:6px;border-bottom:1px solid #232a36;padding-bottom:5px\"><span style=\"font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700\"><svg class=\"ic\" style=\"width:13px;height:13px;vertical-align:-2px\"><use href=\"#i-insight\"/></svg> 判讀</span><span style=\"font-size:10.5px;color:#6b7385\">2026-09-07 · 公開版</span><span style=\"font-size:11px;color:#6b7385\">· 資料 10:40</span></div><style id=\"sdscn-style\">\n/* SCENARIO 分岔航路圖 v4：NOW 幹線 → 三條航道（長度/厚度=機率）＋航道上的絆線 */\n.scn-fork{position:relative;padding-left:26px;padding-top:15px;margin:4px 0 0}\n.scn-fork::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:9px;top:11px;bottom:20px;width:2px;background:linear-gradient(180deg,#ff8a3d66,#8a93a6,#2a3140)}\n.scn-now{position:absolute;left:0;top:0;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.18em;color:#ff8a3d}\n.scn-now i{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:#ff8a3d;box-shadow:0 0 9px rgba(255,138,61,.8)}\n.scn-route{position:relative;margin:8px 0;padding-left:2px}\n.scn-route::before{content:\"\";position:absolute;left:-17px;top:calc(var(--bh)/2 + 1px);width:17px;height:2px;background:var(--c);opacity:.55}\n.scn-lane{min-width:0}\n.scn-rbar{position:relative;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:7px;height:var(--bh);width:var(--w);min-width:140px;max-width:100%;padding:0 8px;border:1px solid var(--c);background:var(--bg);overflow:hidden;box-shadow:inset 0 0 14px -8px var(--c)}\n.scn-rbar::after{content:\"\";position:absolute;inset:0;pointer-events:none;background:repeating-linear-gradient(90deg,transparent 0 12px,rgba(255,255,255,.05) 12px 15px)}\n.scn-route.scn-max .scn-rbar{box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 1px var(--c),inset 0 0 22px -8px var(--c),0 0 14px -6px var(--c)}\n.scn-route.scn-max .scn-rbar::after{animation:scnflow 2.6s linear infinite}\n@keyframes scnflow{from{transform:translateX(0)}to{transform:translateX(15px)}}\n@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.scn-route.scn-max .scn-rbar::after{animation:none}}\n.scn-rbar b{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;color:var(--c);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;line-height:1}\n.scn-rbar em{font-style:normal;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--c);opacity:.9;white-space:nowrap}\n.scn-rbar .cap{margin-left:auto;width:5px;height:5px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--c);box-shadow:0 0 6px var(--c);flex:0 0 auto}\n.scn-trip{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:6px;margin-top:3px;font-size:10.5px;line-height:1.5;color:#cdd6e4}\n.scn-trip .tw{flex:0 0 auto;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:8px;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--c);opacity:.75;border:1px solid var(--c);padding:0 4px;transform:translateY(-1px)}\n.scn-trip .cl{color:#7d8799}\n.twn{font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:10px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;color:#e8edf2;background:rgba(255,255,255,.05);border:1px solid #2a3140;padding:0 4px;margin:0 1px;white-space:nowrap}\n@media(max-width:560px){.scn-rbar{width:100%!important}.scn-trip{flex-wrap:wrap}}\n</style><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#8a93a6;margin:0 0 3px\">SCENARIO TREE · 情境分岔 機率加權</div><div class=\"scn-fork\"><div class=\"scn-now\"><i></i>NOW</div><div class=\"scn-route scn-max\" style=\"--c:#4ade80;--bg:rgba(74,222,128,.07);--bh:22px\"><div class=\"scn-lane\"><div class=\"scn-rbar\" style=\"width:100%\"><b>55%</b><em>基準</em><span class=\"cap\"></span></div><div class=\"scn-trip\"><span class=\"tw\">TRIPWIRE</span><span><span class=\"cl\">—</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"scn-route\" style=\"--c:#fbbf24;--bg:rgba(251,191,36,.07);--bh:17px\"><div class=\"scn-lane\"><div class=\"scn-rbar\" style=\"width:76%\"><b>35%</b><em>風險</em><span class=\"cap\"></span></div><div class=\"scn-trip\"><span class=\"tw\">TRIPWIRE</span><span><span class=\"cl\">—</span></span></div></div></div><div class=\"scn-route\" style=\"--c:#f87171;--bg:rgba(248,113,113,.07);--bh:13px\"><div class=\"scn-lane\"><div class=\"scn-rbar\" style=\"width:45%\"><b>10%</b><em>尾端</em><span class=\"cap\"></span></div><div class=\"scn-trip\"><span class=\"tw\">TRIPWIRE</span><span><span class=\"cl\">—</span></span></div></div></div></div><div class=\"judg-hint\" style=\"margin-top:5px;font-size:11px;color:#60a5fa;user-select:none\">展開完整判讀（情境 · 判讀 · 要聞 · 建議）▾</div></summary><div style=\"margin-top:4px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;border-left:2px solid #4ade80;background:rgba(74,222,128,.07);padding:6px 11px;margin:4px 0\"><span style=\"color:#4ade80;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">基準</span><span style=\"color:#c3cad6\">台積電 9/10 營收符合預期、9/11 CPI 溫和，大盤守住 46,500 以上，半導體基本面族群延續強勢 → 否證：台積電 9/10 營收月衰退，或 CPI 年增率 ≥ 3.5%</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;border-left:2px solid #fbbf24;background:rgba(251,191,36,.07);padding:6px 11px;margin:4px 0\"><span style=\"color:#fbbf24;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">風險</span><span style=\"color:#c3cad6\">CPI 受服務業通膨推升偏高，美債突破 4.80%，外資動向翻空，台股回測 45,500 → 觸發：CPI 年增率 ≥ 3.5% 且美債快速上行</span></div><div style=\"display:flex;gap:9px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.55;border-left:2px solid #f87171;background:rgba(248,113,113,.07);padding:6px 11px;margin:4px 0\"><span style=\"color:#f87171;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap\">尾端</span><span style=\"color:#c3cad6\">美中半導體司法衝突觸發新制裁、Brent 突破 100 美元，市場風險溢酬跳升，台股跌破 44,000 → 觸發：Brent 站穩 100 以上或美方對長江存儲展開反制行動</span></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#fbbf24;margin:14px 0 6px\">EDITORIAL · 判讀 首席觀點</div><div style=\"border-left:2px solid #fbbf24;background:rgba(251,191,36,.04);padding:8px 12px\"><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#dbe2ec\">今天的主軸是「費半漲勢跨海接棒，但強勢是孤立的」。SOX 上週五跳 3.38%，TSM ADR 同步漲 2.85%；今天台積電開在 2,450，TWII 站上 47,338。然而 S&amp;P 上週五同天跌 0.38%，費半的強是結構性需求訊號，而非美股全面轉多——接棒效應有上限，不能把它讀成多頭重啟。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#dbe2ec\">本庫氣壓場今天評偏逆風（分數 −1）。美債殖利率卡在 4.77% 是主要阻力，籌碼面 −8.2 萬口仍偏空。族群訊號榜（截至 09/04）由金融（58.5）領先，AI Server 雖正值但僅 28.6、排第五——資金已移向防禦族群，和鴻海波段跌 27% 的方向吻合，兩者相互印證。此外，ISM 服務業 8 月價格分項 72.6、製造業 71.1，雙雙居高，這是 9/11 CPI 的先行警報，不能輕忽。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12.5px;line-height:1.65;color:#dbe2ec\">接下來的兩個定錨點決定今天漲勢的品質。9/10 台積電 8 月營收驗證台積電 2,450 有無基本面撐腰；9/11 美國 CPI 決定美債能否從 4.77% 鬆動。兩者任何一個令市場失望，今天的開高都將面臨回頭測試。</div></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#60a5fa;margin:14px 0 6px\">WIRE · 要聞 主編快報</div><div style=\"border-left:2px solid #60a5fa;background:rgba(96,165,250,.04);padding:8px 12px\"><div style=\"display:flex;gap:6px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin:0 0 8px\"><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">加權 47257.9<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+1.52%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">台積電 2460<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+2.07%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">費半 11735.3<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+3.38%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">VIX 14.53<span style=\"color:#f87171;margin-left:5px\">+1.47%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">WTI 91.48<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.20%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">Brent 96.28<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.80%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">黃金 4476.6<span style=\"color:#f87171;margin-left:5px\">-1.39%</span></span><span style=\"font-size:11px;background:#10131a;border:1px solid #232a36;border-radius:6px;padding:3px 8px;color:#dbe2ec;font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums\">DXY 99.178<span style=\"color:#4ade80;margin-left:5px\">+0.00%</span></span></div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">聯電今早飆上漲停，成交量達 29 萬張。驅動力是 8 月營收利多；本庫（09/07 數據）評等 watch、fair value 114.05。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">鴻海自高點波段跌幅達 27%，市場公開質疑「AI 題材快漲完了」。本庫（09/04 數據）評等 accumulate、fair value 284。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">長江存儲在美對美光提出 27 項專利侵權訴訟，美中半導體對立延伸進司法戰場。同期，韓媒報導三星與 SK 海力士面臨前所未有的記憶體短缺。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">藥華藥因納入 0050 成分股、8 月營收再創高而受到市場注目；本庫（09/04 數據）評等 hold、fair value 1,261。</div><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#c3cad6\">台光電 8 月營收首度突破 200 億元，M9 等高階 CCL 出貨增加，PTFE CCL 影響估計有限；本庫（09/02 數據）評等 hold、fair value 5,395。</div></div><div style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#4ade80;margin:14px 0 6px\">ACTION · 建議 須人審</div><div style=\"border-left:2px solid #4ade80;background:rgba(74,222,128,.05);padding:8px 12px\"><div style=\"margin:4px 0;font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:#cdd6e4\">公開觀察，非交易指令，須人審：</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• 9/10 台積電 8 月營收：觀察月增幅正負，是今天 2,450 能否站穩的核心依據</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• 9/11 美國 CPI：盯服務業通膨年增幅；ISM 服務價格 72.6 是超預期的先行訊號，門檻約 3.3–3.4%</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• 聯電漲停後量能：觀察量縮是否守住，本庫評 watch（fair value 114.05），漲停後是確認還是洗牌待下一交易日驗證</div><div style=\"margin:3px 0 3px 4px;font-size:12px;line-height:1.6;color:#cdd6e4\">• AI Server 族群訊號榜：當前 28.6（09/04 數據），若下期繼續滑落，與鴻海跌 27% 共同指向 AI 溢價壓縮尚未結束</div></div><div style=\"font-size:11px;line-height:1.55;color:#8a93a6;border-top:1px solid #232a36;margin-top:14px;padding-top:9px\"><span style=\"font-family:ui-monospace,monospace;font-size:9.5px;letter-spacing:.16em;color:#aab3c2\">DELTA · 與昨日差異</span><br>昨日軸是「費半漲但美股不買單、CPI 是未爆彈」；今天軸轉移為「費半接棒台股已實現，焦點從費半 vs 美股的宏觀分歧，轉向 AI 估值 vs 基本面的族群內部分化」——驅動差異是聯電漲停（基本面落地）與鴻海跌 27%（估值壓縮）這組對比事件同日浮出。</div><div style=\"font-size:10px;color:#525c70;margin-top:11px\">來源：news_monitor / TWSE MIS + FMTQIK / Yahoo Finance snapshot / 2026 事件軸 / Sixdust 研究庫。資料時間：2026-09-07 10:40 GMT+8。本稿為公開市場與族群層級判讀，非投資建議。</div></div></details>\n<style>#judgment>summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}</style>\n<script>(function(){var d=document.getElementById('judgment');if(!d||d.tagName!=='DETAILS')return;\nvar h=d.querySelector('.judg-hint');function u(){if(h)h.textContent=d.open?'收合判讀 ▴':'展開完整判讀（情境 · 判讀 · 要聞 · 建議）▾'}\nd.addEventListener('toggle',u);u();\nfunction o(){if(location.hash==='#judgment')d.open=true}addEventListener('hashchange',o);o();\ndocument.addEventListener('click',function(e){var a=e.target&&e.target.closest&&e.target.closest('a[href=\"#judgment\"]');if(a)d.open=true});\n})();</script></div></div>\n","tw":"\n<div class=\"uc-row\"><div class=\"uc-tag\">NEWS<span>新聞室</span></div><div class=\"uc-body\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-height:0;padding-top:9px;padding-bottom:9px\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f87171;background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);border-radius:100px;padding:2px 11px;letter-spacing:.02em;white-space:nowrap;flex:none\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f87171;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(248,113,113,.18)\"></span>事件風險 · 地緣-油<span style=\"opacity:.75\"> · 第 56 日</span></span><a href=\"/news_events.html\" style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#60a5fa;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap\">完整新聞室 →</a></span><span style=\"color:#6b7385;font-size:12px\">近 24 小時無達門檻的重大市場新聞</span></div></div>\n","us":"\n<div class=\"uc-row\"><div class=\"uc-tag\">NEWS<span>新聞室</span></div><div class=\"uc-body\" style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:6px;min-height:0;padding-top:9px;padding-bottom:9px\"><span style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><span style=\"display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;font-size:11px;font-weight:700;color:#f87171;background:rgba(248,113,113,.12);border:1px solid rgba(248,113,113,.4);border-radius:100px;padding:2px 11px;letter-spacing:.02em;white-space:nowrap;flex:none\"><span style=\"width:6px;height:6px;border-radius:50%;background:#f87171;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px rgba(248,113,113,.18)\"></span>事件風險 · 地緣-油<span style=\"opacity:.75\"> · 第 56 日</span></span><a href=\"/news_events.html\" style=\"margin-left:auto;color:#60a5fa;font-size:12px;text-decoratio